        "text": "<https:\/\/bayareaequityatlas.org\/about#news>\n\nThe also mentioned us in their latest newsletter:\n\n&gt; *Illuminating Progress – But Continued Inequities – in Local Political Representation* \n&gt; The Bay Area is one of the <https:\/\/www2.policylink.org\/e\/78532\/akdown-2-geo-03000000000041860\/c3w8r2\/650245213?h=RCd6yhN854ffTIn1_WNNcbJ_okGXOSe29877Vwen8aw|most diverse regions> in the nation, but people of color still face significant barriers to accessing and exercising political power. This year’s data on the diversity of high-level elected officials in the Bay Area <https:\/\/www2.policylink.org\/e\/78532\/Electeds2021\/c3w8r4\/650245213?h=RCd6yhN854ffTIn1_WNNcbJ_okGXOSe29877Vwen8aw|revealed> that while the share of Black and Latinx electeds increased after the November 2021 election, our political leaders are still not representative of the region’s rich diversity: People of color make up 60 percent of the region’s population but just 34 percent of top elected officials. With Bay Rising, we hosted a <https:\/\/www2.policylink.org\/e\/78532\/-diversity-of-electeds-9-14-21\/c3w8r6\/650245213?h=RCd6yhN854ffTIn1_WNNcbJ_okGXOSe29877Vwen8aw|panel discussion> exploring the challenges candidates face and pathways for increasing political representation, where Clarissa Doutherd and Shanthi Gonzales shared their experiences as women of color running for Oakland Unified School District board. The _<https:\/\/www2.policylink.org\/e\/78532\/d-amount-of-Black-16493649-php\/c3w8r8\/650245213?h=RCd6yhN854ffTIn1_WNNcbJ_okGXOSe29877Vwen8aw|San Francisco Chronicle>, <https:\/\/www2.policylink.org\/e\/78532\/Elected-Officials-16417487-php\/c3w8rb\/650245213?h=RCd6yhN854ffTIn1_WNNcbJ_okGXOSe29877Vwen8aw|SF Gate>, *<https:\/\/www2.policylink.org\/e\/78532\/t-reflect-bay-areas-diversity-\/c3w8rd\/650245213?h=RCd6yhN854ffTIn1_WNNcbJ_okGXOSe29877Vwen8aw|San Francisco Public Press>*_, and the _<https:\/\/www2.policylink.org\/e\/78532\/6c-11ec-abdf-c3b7639a3cd4-html\/c3w8rg\/650245213?h=RCd6yhN854ffTIn1_WNNcbJ_okGXOSe29877Vwen8aw|Daily Journal>_ reported on our analysis.\n",
        "team": "T036YAYMK",
        "user_team": "T036YAYMK",
        "source_team": "T036YAYMK",
