        "text": "Yes, thanks for reminding me that we serve the NPO's as well as serving the listeners+readers. I love that when cmty orgs brag about media coverage then people get an imprint of SFPublicPress!\n\nIs there any mechanism already in place that reaches back out to featured groups and invites them to spread the word via their newsletters or social?\n\n{oops this was stuck in drafts for many hours sorry if it's out of step with the thread}",
        "team": "T036YAYMK",
        "user_team": "T036YAYMK",
        "source_team": "T036YAYMK",
        "user_profile": {
